{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788542383844394001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"wedded-continued-crane","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"c7f7e92a0f2d3e7540a8a5e9f4d7eb43bb8bb0f8ae8325573233bdfd73d70e39","event_uuid":"76127521-3b26-44e1-a386-596cda5f38ec","position":{"commit_sha":"593485754eac30a881bc38c51c855369b285a3cd","position":"1788530503599155001-76127521-3b26-44e1-a386-596cda5f38ec"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"300512cba6e877fb65d0e1015546cae1584839c75fd628727c19dc159d3ca7e5","event_uuid":"1024f362-d491-4741-9705-ab503b9c9109","position":{"commit_sha":"b87888b031432eaeeedc6c49aa232dbf42d81fe1","position":"1788530525034500001-1024f362-d491-4741-9705-ab503b9c9109"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788530503599155001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"1024f362-d491-4741-9705-ab503b9c9109","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"5169-ab69-9c23-4f8b"}],"description":"## Context\n\nDeferred non-blocking advisories from the change-triggered criterion-eval work (ticket 5169,\nepic R-4 `spin-cub-usher` / 65dd-e93b-666a-4caa). Each was dispositioned defer-followup: all\nare non-blocking, LLM-Review+1 was granted, the `eval-changed-rubrics` job is\ncontinue-on-error, and CI itself uses ANTHROPIC/OPENAI credentials so the gating is correct\nfor CI today. They matter for portability (non-CI / Bedrock-only environments) and test\ncoverage, so they are collected here rather than dropped.\n\n## Scope\n\n`src/rebar/_cli/_llm_eval_commands.py` (the live criteria-eval availability check and the\nchange-triggered run loop) and its unit tests.\n\n## Deferred items to disposition\n\n- [ ] `_live_criteria_eval_available` gates on ANTHROPIC/OPENAI env only; a Bedrock repo\n      model with Bedrock creds is seen as \"no live\", so a Bedrock-only environment silently\n      skips the live half.\n- [ ] Fail-open: when live is available but every criterion raises LLMError, the run returns\n      None and the caller exits 0 unconditionally, even under `--require-live`.\n- [ ] Empty `--changed-since ''` is not treated as a null ref; it falls through to the\n      missing-criterion error (exit 2) instead of a clean no-op.\n- [ ] The per-criterion LLMError recovery path in the live-run loop has no test.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Each item above is either fixed (with a covering test where it is a correctness or\n      coverage gap) or explicitly accepted with a one-line reason recorded on this ticket.\n      In particular, decide whether `--require-live` must fail non-zero when live was\n      available but produced no successful evaluation.\n\n## Budget\n\nTo be estimated when claimed.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"87a9-043b-9028-449e","ticket_type":"task","title":"Follow-up: live criteria-eval availability gating and fail-open under --require-live (R-4)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["76127521-3b26-44e1-a386-596cda5f38ec","1024f362-d491-4741-9705-ab503b9c9109"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788542383844394001,"uuid":"080db9c5-9b06-46c3-87e1-bf8428ab14bd"}